0	section	Talking to Juliet
1	line	Player	Juliet, I come from Romeo. He begs me to tell you that he cares still.
1	line	Juliet	Oh how my heart soars to hear this news! Please take this message to him with great haste.
1	line	Player	Well, I hope it's good news...he was quite upset when I left him.
1	line	Juliet	He's quite often upset...the poor sensitive soul. But I don't think he's going to take this news very well, however, all is not lost.
1	line	Juliet	Everything is explained in the letter, would you be so kind and deliver it to him please?
1	line	Player	Certainly, I'll do so straight away.
1	line	Juliet	Many thanks! Oh, I'm so very grateful. You may be our only hope.
