1	line	Phillipa	And I'm sure Romeo is just the sort of jester to make her laugh out loud - hysterically you might say.
1	line	Phillipa	He always brings a tear to my eyes - tears of happiness at his foolish antics!
1	line	Player	Oh, thanks. I like to do my cupid bit.
