2	line	Romeo	No, no, not one!
2	line	Romeo	Oh, well, except for the occasional court summons.
2	line	Romeo	But they're not really 'nice' messages. Not like this one! I'm sure that this message will be lovely.
2	line	Player	Well are you going to open it or not?
2	line	Romeo	Oh yes, yes, of course! 'Dearest Romeo, I am very pleased that you sent {player} to look for me and to tell me that you still hold affliction...', Affliction! She thinks I'm diseased?
2	line	Player	'Affection?'
2	line	Romeo	Ahh yes...'still hold affection for me. I still feel great affection for you, but unfortunately my Father opposes our marriage.'
2	line	Player	Oh dear...that doesn't sound too good.
2	line	Romeo	What? '...great affection for you. Father opposes our..
2	line	Romeo	'...marriage and will...
2	line	Romeo	...will kill you if he sees you again!'
