0	section	Talking to the Apothecary
1	line	Apothecary	I am the Apothecary. I brew potions. Do you need anything specific?
1	option	Can you make potions for me?
1	option	Talk about something else.
2	option	Talk about Romeo & Juliet.
3	line	Player	Apothecary, Father Lawrence sent me. I need a Cadava potion to help Romeo and Juliet.
3	line	Apothecary	Cadava potion. It's pretty nasty. And hard to make.
3	line	Apothecary	Wing of rat, tail of frog. Ear of snake and horn of dog.
3	line	Apothecary	I have all that, but I need some Cadava berries.
3	line	Apothecary	You will have to find them while I get the rest ready. Bring them here when you have them. But be careful. They are nasty.
