5	action	other
4	option	Where can I get these berries?
5	line	Player	Where can I get these berries?
5	line	Apothecary	I think I saw some recently in the local vicinity. Oh yes, that's right! There was a little bit of commotion when some kids visited the south eastern Varrock mining pit. The trip was disrupted because some kids
5	line	Apothecary	had found some cadavaberry bushes and they started picking them. They wrapped that trip up pretty quickly!
5	action	other
4	option	How are these berries dangerous?
5	line	Player	How are these berries dangerous?
5	line	Apothecary	Hmm, they're generally okay, but if handled improperly they can be a bit nasty. And I certainly wouldn't advise drinking the potion!
5	action	other
4	option	Ok, thanks.
5	line	Player	Ok, thanks.
