0	section	Talking to Father Lawrence
1	cond	If player is not carrying a cadava potion:
2	line	Father Lawrence	Did you find the Apothecary?
2	line	Player	Yes I did. He's told me I must find some Cadava berries.
2	line	Father Lawrence	Well, good luck with that...they're quite tricky to find.
2	line	Player	Any clues where I can start to look?
2	line	Father Lawrence	I heard some kids saying they saw some the other day. They were visiting the mining place to the south east of Varrock.
2	line	Player	Ok, that's as good a place to start looking as any.
2	action	end
