0	section	Talking to Romeo
1	cond	If player is not carrying a cadava potion:
2	line	Player	Hi Romeo!
2	line	Romeo	Oh hello, have you seen Lather Fawrence?
2	line	Player	Yes, he's given me details of a potion which should help resolve this situation. The Apothecary is helping me prepare it.
2	line	Romeo	Ooooh, it all sounds horribly complicated?
2	line	Romeo	All I can say is I'll be glad when Juliet's finally in that crypt!
2	line	Player	Spoken like a true lover!
2	action	end
1	cond	If player is carrying a cadava potion:
2	box	Romeo spots the Cadava potion.
2	line	Romeo	Ooohh, that's the potion is it? Rather you than me!
2	line	Player	I'm not drinking it! It's for Juliet!
2	line	Romeo	Well, I mean...it's probably delicious...and not dangerous at all. And you quite often see harmless drinks in a glowing sort of pink colour.
2	line	Player	Hmm, I'm not convinced...maybe you ought to try some before I give it to Juliet?
2	line	Romeo	Urgh! No way! Not in a million years!
2	line	Player	Ok...but you know what to do when I've given this to Juliet?
2	line	Romeo	Oh, yeah...sure Lather Fawrence explained all that to me...
2	action	end
0	section	Talking to Draul Leptoc
1	line	Draul Leptoc	Hey , what are you doing here?
1	line	Player	Nothing much sir...I promise...I'm just an innocent friend of Juliet's...doing her a few favours...as a friend.
1	line	Draul Leptoc	Well, just make sure there's no funny business going on that's all I can say. Do you know why?
1	line	Player	I think I can guess sir...
1	line	Draul Leptoc	There's no need to guess! You can see it in my hawk like eyes, in my cat like ears and my dog like nose...
1	line	Player	Are you saying that you look like an animal sir?
1	line	Draul Leptoc	NO! Not look like an animal! I have the keen 'SENSES' of an animal and I don't miss a thing. Don't even think about trying anything!
1	action	If the player currently has the cadava potion:
2	box	Draul notices the potion!
2	line	Draul Leptoc	Hey! What's that in your hands? Looks like some sort of potion to me!
2	line	Player	Err...no! Nope! Not a potion! Some medicine...I have a terrible cough ...cough...cough....see?
2	line	Player	>Except, I can't drink too much or else it makes me feel 'really' tired. One sip of this and the lights go out...I mean, I'm asleep in a minute.
2	line	Draul Leptoc	Sleep!
2	line	Draul Leptoc	Sleep...! How can you even think of such a thing at a time like this? And I hope you have no intentions of sleeping in my house!
2	line	Draul Leptoc	You'll get a bill for rent if I catch you dozing off around here!
2	action	end
1	action	end
