0	section	Talking to Juliet
1	cond	If the player doesn't have a Cadava potion in their inventory:
2	line	Player	Hi Juliet!
2	line	Juliet	Hi {player}, how close am I to being with my true love Romeo?
2	line	Player	Sorry, I still have to get a special potion for you.
2	line	Juliet	Oh, I hope it isn't a love potion because you would be wasting your time. My love for Romeo grows stronger every minute...
2	line	Player	That must be because you're not with him...
2	line	Juliet	Oh no! I long to be close to my true love Romeo!
2	line	Player	Well, ok then...I'll set about getting this potion as quickly as I can!
2	line	Juliet	Fair luck to you, the end is close.
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player has a Cadava potion in their inventory:
2	line	Player	Hi Juliet! I have an interesting proposition for you...suggested by Father Lawrence. It may be the only way you'll be able to escape from this house and be with Romeo.
2	line	Juliet	Go on....
2	line	Player	I have a Cadava potion here, suggested by Father Lawrence. If you drink it, it will make you appear dead!
2	line	Juliet	Yes...
2	line	Player	And when you appear dead...your still and lifeless corpse will be removed to the crypt!
2	line	Juliet	Oooooh, a cold dark creepy crypt...
2	line	Juliet	...sounds just peachy!
2	line	Player	Then...Romeo can steal into the crypt and rescue you just as you wake up!
2	line	Juliet	...and this is the great idea for getting me out of here?
2	line	Player	To be fair, I can't take all the credit...in fact...it was all Father Lawrence's suggestion...
2	line	Juliet	Ok...if this is the best we can do...hand over the potion!
2	box	You pass the suspicious potion to Juliet.
1	line	Juliet	Wonderful! I just hope Romeo can remember to get me from the crypt.
2	line	Juliet	Please go to Romeo and make sure he understands. Although I love his gormless, lovelorn soppy ways, he can be a bit dense sometimes and I don't want to wake up in that crypt on my own.
2	line	Juliet	Oh, here's Phillipa, my cousin...she's in on the plot too!
2	line	Juliet	She's going to make it seem even more convincing!
2	line	Phillipa	Yes, I'm quite the actress! Good luck dear cousin!
2	line	Juliet	Right...bottoms up!
2	line	Juliet	Urk!
2	line	Phillipa	Oh no...Juliet has...died!
2	line	Player	You might be more believable if you're not smiling when you say it...
2	line	Phillipa	Oh yeah...you might be right...ok, let's try again.
2	line	Phillipa	Oh no...Juliet has...died?
2	line	Player	Perhaps a bit louder, like you're upset...that your cousin has died!
2	line	Phillipa	Right...yes...Ok, ok, I think I'm getting my motivation now. Ok, let's try this again!
2	line	Phillipa	OH NO...JULIET HAS...DIED?.... Oooooohhhhhh....(sob), (sob).Juliet...my poor dead cousin!
2	line	Draul Leptoc	What's all that screaming?
2	line	Draul Leptoc	Oh no! My poor daughter...what has become of you?
2	line	Phillipa	Poor Juliet...make preparations for her body to be placed in the Crypt...
2	action	end
